# Codegen Boundaries

Generated files are read-only by convention.

## Never edit manually

- `src/codegen/**`
- `src/codegen/router/route-tree.gen.ts`

## Make changes through generators

- API schemas update: `pnpm api:download`
- API code generation: `pnpm api:generate` (or `pnpm api:generate:hey-api` when explicitly needed)
- Router tree generation: `pnpm router:generate`

## Implementation rule

- If requested behavior requires changing generated output, edit source inputs/configs (`scripts`, `kubb.config.ts`, `src/routes/**`, schema files), then regenerate.
